#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:1
msgid "Minhang core technology R&D projects"
msgstr "闵行关键核心技术攻关"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:4
msgid "Grant | Minhang"
msgstr "补助｜闵行区"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:6
msgid "Policy in force; call not confirmed open"
msgstr "政策有效，未确认正在申报"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S098 "
"<https://english.shanghai.gov.cn/en-PolicyInsights/20250919/38bbef698b904adabd605170e7720a4d.html>`_. "
"Minhang amplifies enterprise sci-tech innovation_Policy Insights."
msgstr "`证据 S098 <https://english.shanghai.gov.cn/en-PolicyInsights/20250919/38bbef698b904adabd605170e7720a4d.html>`_. Minhang amplifies enterprise sci-tech innovation_Policy Insights."

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与机制"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:13
msgid ""
"General: up to RMB 3m at up to 30% of R&D; major: up to RMB 10m at up to "
"50%"
msgstr "一般项目按研发投入最高30%、最高300万元；重大项目按最高50%、最高1000万元"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:15
msgid "No equity"
msgstr "不占股"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "资格与时间"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:20
msgid ""
"Project classification and investment thresholds apply. This is selective "
"R&D support, not a general startup incorporation bonus."
msgstr "适用项目分类与投资门槛，为择优研发支持，不是普遍适用的企业开办奖励。"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:22
msgid "Policy through 31 Aug 2030"
msgstr "政策有效期至2030年8月31日"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "联系与申请"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:27
msgid "`Official application / policy route <https://www.shmh.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请／政策入口 <https://www.shmh.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:29
msgid ""
"The linked authority or operator is the contact route. A direct current "
"program contact is not established in this profile."
msgstr "请通过所链主管部门或运营方联系，本档案未核实现任项目直接联系人。"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../funding/minhang-rd.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布最高额为上限，不构成当然权益。须核验适用通知、合资格支出期间、其他财政资助及书面拨付条件。"
